# Copy to .env and adjust. Everything has a default that fits this machine.

# The engine: ComfyUI's core as a library in our own worker (app/engine/h3worker.py) - no server, no port. Default:
# Remiqora Video's own, engine\ComfyUI and engine\.venv (install.bat sets them up); until then Comfy Desktop's
# (<COMFY_DIR>\ComfyUI\comfy and the venv inside it)
# COMFY_DIR=D:\remiqora-video\engine
# COMFY_PYTHON=D:\remiqora-video\engine\.venv\Scripts\python.exe
# The worker's input / output folders and its log
# COMFY_INPUT=data\comfy\input
# COMFY_OUTPUT=data\comfy\output
# WORKER_LOG=data\h3worker.log

# The worker's weight folders, separated by ; - every model's weights: H3, LTX, WAN, Krea (their diffusion_models,
# text_encoders, vae, loras, checkpoints, latent_upscale_models; H3_REF_DIR and the LoRA folders below are added to them).
# Default: models\ beside the app; the folders below default to places inside the first one (models\loras\h3...)
# H3_MODEL_ROOTS=D:\models\comfyui

# H3 weights (names only, looked up in the weight folders)
# H3_UNET=minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors
# the official model's 8-step turbo LoRA; a model with the speed-up built in (TURBO in its name) shoots without it
# H3_TURBO_LORA=minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors
# H3_CLIP=qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors
# H3_VAE=minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors
# H3_AUDIO_VAE=minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors
# Ref2VA (H3's faces from photos): its model, its turbo LoRA and their folder
# H3_REF_UNET=minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors
# H3_REF_LORA=minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors
# H3_REF_DIR=D:\models\comfyui

# LTX 2.5 weights
# LTX25_UNET=ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors
# LTX25_CLIP=gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors
# LTX25_VAE=ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors
# LTX25_AUDIO_VAE=ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors
# LTX25_UPSCALER=ltx-2.5-latent-spatial-upscaler-x2-bf16-1.0.safetensors
# LTX 2.3 weights
# LTX23_CKPT=ltx-2.3-22b-dev-fp8.safetensors
# LTX23_CLIP=gemma_3_12B_it_fp4_mixed.safetensors
# LTX23_LORA=ltx_2.3_22b_distilled_1.1_lora_dynamic_fro09_avg_rank_111_bf16.safetensors
# LTX23_UPSCALER=ltx-2.3-spatial-upscaler-x2-1.1.safetensors
# WAN 2.2 5B weights; WAN_FAST_LORA - FastWan's LoRA (the model «WAN 2.2 5B · FastWan»)
# WAN_UNET=wan2.2_ti2v_5B_fp16.safetensors
# WAN_CLIP=umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors
# WAN_VAE=wan2.2_vae.safetensors
# WAN_FAST_LORA=Wan2_2_5B_FastWanFullAttn_lora_rank_128_bf16.safetensors
# Krea 2 (the pictures) weights
# KREA_UNET=krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors
# KREA_CLIP=qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors
# KREA_VAE=qwen_image_vae.safetensors
# FLUX.2 Klein 4B (the scenes' start frames, places, «Картинка» by reference) weights
# FLUX2_UNET=flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors
# FLUX2_CLIP=qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors
# FLUX2_VAE=flux2-vae.safetensors
# The pictures' steps (Krea 2 Turbo 8, FLUX.2 Klein 4) and the start frames' face check (SFace below FRAME_FACE_MIN - another
# person; FRAME_TRIES seeds tried)
# KREA_STEPS=8
# FLUX2_STEPS=4
# FRAME_FACE_MIN=0.3
# FRAME_TRIES=3

# LoRA for H3, separated by ;
# LORA_DIRS=D:\models\comfyui\loras\h3
# LoRA for LTX, each version its own folders (a LoRA of one does not fit the other), separated by ;
# LTX23_LORA_DIRS=D:\models\comfyui\loras\ltx23
# LTX25_LORA_DIRS=D:\models\comfyui\loras\ltx25
# LoRA for WAN 2.2 5B (FastWan takes them too) and for Krea 2, separated by ;
# WAN_LORA_DIRS=D:\models\comfyui\loras\wan5b
# KREA_LORA_DIRS=D:\models\comfyui\loras\krea2
# FLUX2_LORA_DIRS=D:\models\comfyui\loras\flux2

# Output: RTX Video Super Resolution (1080p, 4K, HDR10), RIFE (48 fps; RIFE_MODEL - a folder beside the exe), ffmpeg
# default: tools\rtxvsr\rtx_vsr.exe (tools\rtxvsr\build.ps1 builds it from NVIDIA's RTX Video SDK) and tools\rife\
# RTX_VSR=D:\tools\rtxvsr\rtx_vsr.exe
# RIFE_BIN=D:\tools\rife\rife-ncnn-vulkan.exe
# RIFE_MODEL=rife-v4.6
# FFMPEG=ffmpeg
# FFPROBE=ffprobe

# The words of a song (Demucs + Whisper): optional Python override and the Whisper model
# LYRICS_PYTHON=D:\remiqora-video\tools\lyrics\.venv\Scripts\python.exe
# LYRICS_MODEL=large-v3

# The writer: our own llama-server (llama.cpp), started for every LLM job and stopped after; LM Studio is not needed
# Default: tools\llama\llama-server.exe (its DLLs beside it), else the CUDA engine of an installed LM Studio (signed:
# Windows' Smart App Control may block an unsigned llama.cpp build, even an official release).
# LLAMA_SERVER_BIN=D:\tools\llama\llama-server.exe
# GGUF folders, separated by ; (default: llm\ in the first weight folder + LM Studio's download folder).
# A model downloaded in LM Studio shows up here by itself; its mmproj (vision) is paired by folder or by name.
# LLM_DIRS=D:\models\comfyui\llm;D:\lmstudio\models
# LLM_MODEL=gemma-4-E4B
# LLM_PORT=8191
# LLM_CTX=16384

# Server
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# PORT=8810
